> Quit the chit-chat. Tell me what you need and I’ll make it for you, provided your descriptions are reasonable.
> — Mortefi

He hails from the [[New Federation]] and is the head of the Branch of Tacetite Weaponry within the Department of Safety in [[Huaxu Academy]] at [[Jinzhou]].

==Official Introduction==
> Born into the upper class, Mortefi is a lofty man with an erudite look.
Renowned for his exceptional talent in scientific research, Mortefi was once famed as the youngest genius in the New Federation.
Driven by a thirst for knowledge, Mortefi later abandoned his privileged life to work as an International Research Fellow at the Huaxu Academy.
It's not hard to win Mortefi's favor: Just remember to talk nicely, and always shower him with ample praise.
> — [https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com/en/main#resonators His introduction on the Official Website.]